# Timeline catalog (hard gate)

Authority: [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) Content density **Chronological
timeline**; [`llm/CONSUMER_TREATY.md`](../../llm/CONSUMER_TREATY.md);
pasteable [`llm/consumer-cursor-rule.mdc`](../../llm/consumer-cursor-rule.mdc).
Consumer-reported pattern bugs → `/constrain-then-consumer`
([`.cursor/skills/constrain-then-consumer/SKILL.md`](../skills/constrain-then-consumer/SKILL.md)).

## Do

1. Dated history with a **vertical rail** → **`Timeline` / `TimelineItem`**
   (`headline` / org `supportingText` / dates `trailingSupportingText` +
   `trailingMetaAlign="start"`). Live `#timeline`.
2. Node→copy (`--fynns-timeline-gap`) and expandable chevron→copy
   (`--fynns-timeline-chevron-gap`) both alias `--fynns-list-gap` (**16dp**) —
   same breath as List leading→copy (≥ 0.5.6). Hover pill height comes from
   `--fynns-timeline-pad-block` → `--fynns-list-pad-block` (**8dp**, ≥ 0.5.7)
   — never crush to `space-xs` (**4dp**). Hover wash starts at
   `--fynns-timeline-hover-inset-inline-start` (`node-col` + `gap`, ≥ 0.5.8)
   — never flush to the node edge. Content **inside** the wash uses
   `--fynns-timeline-pad-inline-start` = `radius-md` + `space-xs` (**24dp**,
   ≥ 0.5.10) — chevron/headline clear the wash curve (not List pad alone).
3. Sandbox teaches **exactly two shells** — unlabeled:
   - **Flat** Timeline (no expand) — **catalog edit default:** row click →
     Dialog; edit / delete in Dialog foot (**not** `--with-end` hover icons)
   - Timeline **with `detail`** (optional **read** bullets under the node —
     no row action IconButtons)
4. Prefer **omit `leading`** (default disc). Kind / role chrome → Dialog fields.
5. Title + org + dates **without** a rail → plain **List** org+dates (`#list`) —
   never paint a fake rail on List.
6. Sandbox copy = **generic UI shell** only (see `no-consumer-content.mdc`).

## Don't (hard)

- Letter / number **comparison chrome** in sandbox or keep-set docs as the
  product UI: **A / B / C**, `Variant A`, `Shell A`, `A · flat`, `B list-detail`,
  `C with detail`, or any A/B/C ranking of timeline hosts
- A third host **`list-detail`** (List + chevron / expand masquerading as a
  timeline middle option) — retired; never reintroduce in core demos or as a
  recommended consumer layout mode
- List start tick / inset rail / `::before` bar to fake chronology
- **ChatActivity** or **Tree** for role / org / date history rows
- **`--with-end` hover edit/delete IconButtons** on Timeline as the default
  catalog recipe (List path-catalog chrome on a rail) — actions belong in the
  Dialog after row click
- Crushing node/chevron→copy to `control-cluster-gap` (**4dp**) or private
  pad/margin on `.fynns-timeline-*`
- Consumer product strings (résumé / employer / university / CV Generator
  Experiences) in Globals `#timeline`
- Shipping Timeline / density fixes **only** in a consumer — constrain core +
  sandbox demo + publish, then subagent consumer verify

## Gate

- This rule (on-demand / Timeline globs — not alwaysApply)
- AGENTS Hard rules + Content density row
- `npm run check:no-consumer` (lettered-shell + consumer-product denylist)
- Dual-end browser verify when the bug was consumer-reported
